WEBVTT

01:33.370 --> 01:35.641
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.701 --> 01:38.001
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.070 --> 01:40.971
(Episode 37)

01:50.120 --> 01:50.951
Was it you?

01:52.020 --> 01:53.520
Did you bribe someone with the physical examination...

01:53.751 --> 01:55.721
and make Song Yan fail the entrance exam?

01:58.260 --> 01:59.730
Before he was going to be promoted,

02:00.331 --> 02:01.760
you also got someone to fight with him,

02:02.400 --> 02:04.031
create trouble, and harass him,

02:04.600 --> 02:05.471
didn't you?

02:08.031 --> 02:10.001
He wrote me more than 10 letters.

02:10.600 --> 02:12.040
I didn't receive any of them.

02:13.611 --> 02:14.841
Was that you too?

02:16.140 --> 02:17.341
Who told you?

02:19.550 --> 02:20.450
Song Yan?

02:23.721 --> 02:24.450
Dad.

02:24.950 --> 02:25.790
Were you involved too?

02:28.191 --> 02:29.061
Qin Qin.

02:30.521 --> 02:31.431
Regarding this...

02:31.531 --> 02:34.230
I don't know how to explain it to you.

02:34.661 --> 02:35.330
This matter...

02:36.561 --> 02:38.230
has nothing to do with your dad.

02:39.431 --> 02:42.001
Your dad only found out after the incident.

02:43.241 --> 02:44.271
That...

02:44.911 --> 02:46.070
was my doing.

02:49.480 --> 02:51.211
Is that all you can say?

02:52.480 --> 02:53.681
Forget an apology.

02:54.751 --> 02:56.380
Don't you even have an explanation?

02:56.850 --> 02:58.890
That's a person's fate and future.

03:00.790 --> 03:01.760
Mom.

03:02.521 --> 03:04.290
He's the man I love.

03:05.230 --> 03:06.561
I wanted to get close to him,

03:06.630 --> 03:07.931
but I almost lost him...

03:07.991 --> 03:09.830
because I kept complaining that he didn't do anything for me.

03:12.100 --> 03:13.501
How could you be so nonchalant...

03:13.570 --> 03:16.271
after ruining the man I love?

03:22.341 --> 03:23.580
I've always treated you...

03:23.640 --> 03:24.741
as my real mom.

03:29.251 --> 03:31.691
I was even thinking of initiating a reconciliation with you.

03:32.920 --> 03:33.751
I thought...

03:33.950 --> 03:35.890
maybe this is just your personality.

03:35.961 --> 03:37.760
It's not that you don't treat me like your daughter.

03:42.001 --> 03:43.431
I'm just a fool.

03:46.700 --> 03:47.730
I'm a tool that you raised...

03:47.800 --> 03:49.100
to be used for a business marriage.

03:50.200 --> 03:51.741
This tool has become human.

03:52.110 --> 03:53.911
She has a relationship she wants.

03:54.670 --> 03:56.510
You're afraid she'll be out of your control.

03:57.510 --> 03:59.251
That's why you want to destroy the one she loves,

03:59.950 --> 04:01.850
so she has nothing to look forward to in this life...

04:04.621 --> 04:06.491
and just be your puppet.

04:06.920 --> 04:07.621
Qin Qin.

04:09.021 --> 04:10.991
You can't talk to your mother like that.

04:19.100 --> 04:21.001
Is this how you talk to us?

04:21.230 --> 04:23.100
Are those years of education...

04:23.371 --> 04:24.740
all in vain?

04:26.471 --> 04:27.511
You've lived in this house...

04:28.141 --> 04:29.610
for over a decade.

04:30.211 --> 04:31.750
Just because of this,

04:31.911 --> 04:33.180
because of this man,

04:33.951 --> 04:36.321
are you going to deny everything we've done?

04:36.381 --> 04:37.651
You want to break ties with us?

04:39.721 --> 04:40.420
Yes.

04:41.221 --> 04:43.021
I'm not a perfect mother.

04:43.221 --> 04:44.290
But what about you?

04:45.860 --> 04:47.990
Are you a perfect daughter?

04:49.401 --> 04:50.201
Qin Qin.

04:52.271 --> 04:54.230
You're such a disappointment.

04:57.071 --> 04:58.271
Hypocrite.

05:02.711 --> 05:04.110
What did you say?

05:05.550 --> 05:06.511
Hypocrite.

05:07.250 --> 05:08.680
I've disappointed you?

05:08.951 --> 05:10.680
I've always followed the rules since I was little.

05:10.750 --> 05:11.480
If you tell me to do something,

05:11.550 --> 05:12.490
I won't dare to go against you.

05:12.620 --> 05:15.021
How did I disappoint you?

05:15.990 --> 05:17.920
I just fell in love with him.

05:18.331 --> 05:20.091
You said he's not good enough for me.

05:20.161 --> 05:21.600
What right do you have...

05:21.930 --> 05:23.161
to do such a thing...

05:23.230 --> 05:24.531
and think you're noble?

05:26.000 --> 05:27.500
You're the one who's not good enough.

05:27.701 --> 05:29.600
You can't even call yourself a good person.

05:29.670 --> 05:30.370
Meng Qin!

05:39.980 --> 05:41.451
What do you want to do then?

05:45.591 --> 05:47.690
Go and report me.

05:49.161 --> 05:50.021
Send your mother...

05:50.560 --> 05:52.060
to prison.

06:12.480 --> 06:13.911
I won't hold you accountable...

06:14.881 --> 06:15.980
for what he suffered...

06:17.850 --> 06:18.951
and lost in the past.

06:21.821 --> 06:22.690
From now on,

06:24.620 --> 06:25.860
I have nothing to do...

06:25.930 --> 06:27.560
with you anymore.

06:30.060 --> 06:31.261
I'm warning you.

06:33.971 --> 06:36.000
Don't hurt him again.

06:37.971 --> 06:38.641
Yes.

06:39.341 --> 06:40.471
To you,

06:41.440 --> 06:42.680
I have nothing.

06:44.781 --> 06:46.581
But I can die for him.

07:59.790 --> 08:00.591
Yan Chen.

08:04.321 --> 08:05.190
Ms. Fu.

08:06.631 --> 08:07.560
Yan Chen.

08:08.391 --> 08:09.560
Where are your manners?

08:11.661 --> 08:12.471
Manners?

08:15.670 --> 08:17.071
You've taught me well.

08:19.411 --> 08:20.740
Be a righteous person.

08:27.180 --> 08:28.550
I thought you were one too.

08:30.781 --> 08:31.721
I was taught...

08:32.821 --> 08:34.721
to be filial to you and respect you...

08:35.190 --> 08:36.360
since I was little.

08:38.120 --> 08:39.730
No matter how much pain I was in,

08:40.531 --> 08:42.460
I couldn't bear to hurt you.

08:43.131 --> 08:44.460
I was afraid of disappointing you.

08:48.501 --> 08:49.300
But now...

08:53.011 --> 08:53.940
Stop.

08:55.810 --> 08:56.611
Where are you going?

08:58.481 --> 08:59.381
I'm going out for a while.

08:59.450 --> 09:00.481
You can't go anywhere.

09:09.261 --> 09:10.090
Mom.

09:11.991 --> 09:13.731
Please look at me.

09:17.601 --> 09:18.401
Mom.

09:20.001 --> 09:21.631
Please look at my face.

09:24.040 --> 09:26.040
The one standing in front of you is your son.

09:28.241 --> 09:28.981
All these years,

09:29.040 --> 09:30.810
he has been living in hell every day.

09:32.680 --> 09:34.080
He has been living like an empty shell.

09:36.580 --> 09:38.121
Can't you see that at all?

09:42.320 --> 09:43.090
Right.

09:44.761 --> 09:46.430
The only one you can see is yourself.

09:50.361 --> 09:51.200
Yan Chen.

09:51.401 --> 09:52.430
That's enough.

09:53.871 --> 09:55.241
Stop pressuring them.

09:56.470 --> 09:59.310
Do you have to drive them crazy for you to be satisfied?

10:09.781 --> 10:10.550
Rules...

10:11.550 --> 10:12.351
are rules.

10:14.391 --> 10:15.151
I admit.

10:16.021 --> 10:17.121
I'm not proud...

10:17.491 --> 10:18.761
of those two things I've done.

10:20.361 --> 10:21.661
But who did I do it for?

10:23.261 --> 10:24.430
I did it for the Meng family.

10:25.470 --> 10:26.700
I did it for my child.

10:27.401 --> 10:28.371
I don't regret it.

10:32.241 --> 10:33.040
Back then,

10:33.741 --> 10:34.611
I was against...

10:35.710 --> 10:36.810
Qin Qin's relationship.

10:38.040 --> 10:40.180
But since we've already separated them,

10:40.450 --> 10:43.050
why must you hurt that boy?

10:43.121 --> 10:44.720
His dad was a piece of trash.

10:45.590 --> 10:47.090
His mom would leave them...

10:47.391 --> 10:48.820
just for a little bit of money.

10:49.290 --> 10:50.190
What kind of a son...

10:50.590 --> 10:52.631
can such parents raise?

10:53.661 --> 10:54.790
You want me to let Qin Qin...

10:55.031 --> 10:56.161
be with him?

10:57.531 --> 10:58.800
Over my dead body.

11:21.320 --> 11:22.420
Do you think...

11:23.090 --> 11:24.991
the two of them have broken up?

11:26.460 --> 11:27.790
Don't worry about them.

11:27.861 --> 11:29.401
We can't interfere in their affairs.

11:30.861 --> 11:32.670
All you do is watch TV.

11:35.170 --> 11:37.040
Why is he so unfortunate?

11:41.840 --> 11:42.540
Song Yan.

11:52.021 --> 11:53.320
Let's reconcile.

11:54.891 --> 11:55.891
Let's get back together.

11:58.521 --> 12:00.330
What do you mean?

12:01.391 --> 12:02.560
We didn't break up.

12:04.300 --> 12:05.060
Song Yan.

12:06.371 --> 12:08.970
How did you survive all these years?

12:16.940 --> 12:18.011
I'm sorry.

12:19.710 --> 12:21.710
I shouldn't have distrusted you.

12:23.281 --> 12:24.820
I shouldn't have been willful.

12:26.151 --> 12:27.550
I shouldn't have fought with you...

12:27.621 --> 12:28.720
and left home.

12:30.690 --> 12:31.920
Don't be silly.

12:33.391 --> 12:34.460
It's all in the past now.

12:35.731 --> 12:37.361
You have no idea.

12:37.960 --> 12:40.200
I missed you so much.

12:42.200 --> 12:43.371
I missed you too.

12:50.411 --> 12:51.411
I'm sorry.

13:01.090 --> 13:02.121
Let's go inside.

13:03.121 --> 13:04.361
I have to go back to the station.

13:19.540 --> 13:20.741
They came back together.

13:20.940 --> 13:22.241
That's good news.

13:31.920 --> 13:33.720
I wonder if they've eaten.

13:35.351 --> 13:36.161
They've made up.

13:36.220 --> 13:37.720
Why are you going to them? Are you stupid?

13:38.220 --> 13:39.560
It doesn't matter if they eat or not.

13:39.631 --> 13:40.991
What matters is that they're like this.

13:41.361 --> 13:42.861
You're so indecent.

13:42.930 --> 13:43.601
How annoying.

13:44.001 --> 13:44.800
Come on, let's go inside.

13:44.861 --> 13:45.830
Okay.

13:46.871 --> 13:47.670
Let's go.

14:01.511 --> 14:02.320
Mr. Meng.

14:03.950 --> 14:05.550
Should I call Mr. Xiao?

14:05.621 --> 14:08.220
But he hasn't been here for a long time lately.

14:08.391 --> 14:09.121
It's okay.

14:09.690 --> 14:10.820
This way, please.

14:11.361 --> 14:12.391
Bring me my wine.

14:12.631 --> 14:13.361
Okay.

14:14.661 --> 14:16.460
Bring me Mr. Meng's wine.

14:29.481 --> 14:31.481
Mr. Meng, call me if you need anything.

14:43.560 --> 14:45.161
These are our data from the past few days.

14:45.420 --> 14:46.830
This one is better.

14:47.161 --> 14:48.830
This one has better potential.

14:48.960 --> 14:51.200
- It has to have that vibe to... - Let me answer that.

14:56.271 --> 14:57.340
- Hello. - Hey.

14:57.401 --> 14:58.101
Ye Zi.

14:58.170 --> 15:00.440
Didn't you ask me to call you...

15:00.511 --> 15:01.470
when Mr. Meng comes here?

15:01.540 --> 15:02.680
He's here today.

15:02.940 --> 15:03.710
He's there?

15:04.481 --> 15:05.180
Thank you.

15:05.411 --> 15:06.111
You're welcome.

15:06.180 --> 15:07.050
Why are you thanking me?

15:07.651 --> 15:08.781
Why are you looking for him?

15:09.521 --> 15:10.281
It's nothing.

15:10.381 --> 15:12.351
I just want to thank him for helping me before.

15:12.491 --> 15:13.290
Thank you.

15:15.991 --> 15:17.361
Zhai Miao, I'm going out.

15:18.320 --> 15:19.190
Didn't you promise...

15:19.261 --> 15:20.330
to review this with me?

15:21.031 --> 15:21.830
Tomorrow.

15:21.991 --> 15:22.700
I'll definitely do it with you tomorrow.

15:22.761 --> 15:23.501
I promise.

15:24.800 --> 15:26.371
I'm running late. I'll put on makeup first.

16:03.170 --> 16:04.101
Are you okay?

16:26.531 --> 16:27.460
Why are you here?

16:30.361 --> 16:31.560
You drank so much.

16:33.300 --> 16:34.601
Are you in a bad mood?

16:42.810 --> 16:44.040
I wanted to treat you to a meal...

16:44.481 --> 16:45.511
to repay you for last time.

16:46.050 --> 16:46.851
You said you were busy.

16:48.251 --> 16:50.180
Is something troubling you at work?

17:09.300 --> 17:10.300
Why are you laughing?

17:14.670 --> 17:15.940
Moths and butterflies...

17:17.240 --> 17:18.911
are similar insects,

17:20.651 --> 17:22.450
but they're very different.

17:25.220 --> 17:26.391
Some moths...

17:27.821 --> 17:30.161
have gorgeous wings like butterflies.

17:32.161 --> 17:33.631
It's hard for ordinary people to notice,

17:35.161 --> 17:37.361
but I can tell right away.

17:42.200 --> 17:43.401
There's one more difference.

17:46.270 --> 17:48.470
Butterflies like to fly under the sun.

17:50.740 --> 17:51.811
But moths...

17:53.551 --> 17:55.250
always come out at night.

17:58.480 --> 18:00.321
I don't understand what you're talking about.

18:03.791 --> 18:04.490
Is that so?

18:16.000 --> 18:17.700
It doesn't matter if you understand or not.

18:19.811 --> 18:20.710
Right now,

18:22.210 --> 18:23.510
I just want to be alone.

18:25.341 --> 18:26.180
Yes.

18:27.581 --> 18:28.881
I like you.

18:30.920 --> 18:32.990
But do you have to do this to me?

18:33.750 --> 18:34.591
You like me?

18:37.020 --> 18:38.321
What do you like about me?

18:39.020 --> 18:40.230
I just think you're nice.

18:40.831 --> 18:41.730
There's no reason.

18:42.190 --> 18:42.861
Is that not allowed?

18:52.470 --> 18:53.641
Your student loan.

18:57.611 --> 18:58.841
How much do you pay every month?

19:01.151 --> 19:03.121
How much do you need for your monthly living expenses?

19:05.821 --> 19:06.791
What do you mean?

19:08.020 --> 19:09.321
I'm a businessman.

19:10.791 --> 19:13.260
I deal with all kinds of people every day.

19:14.831 --> 19:16.760
Don't think you're so smart.

19:18.661 --> 19:20.230
And don't think I'm too stupid.

19:21.770 --> 19:24.101
I won't be fooled by you so easily.

19:37.480 --> 19:38.680
So all this time,

19:40.551 --> 19:42.020
you've just been tricking me.

19:50.030 --> 19:51.930
What do you have that's worth tricking you for?

20:11.551 --> 20:12.351
Go away.

22:48.270 --> 22:49.010
Wen Ying.

22:50.480 --> 22:51.710
You must also be tired today.

22:52.111 --> 22:53.051
Get some rest.

22:55.651 --> 22:56.520
I feel...

22:57.381 --> 22:58.250
very uneasy.

23:00.151 --> 23:01.621
Yan Chen...

23:02.391 --> 23:03.760
has never acted this way.

23:06.561 --> 23:07.530
Leave him be.

23:09.801 --> 23:11.131
You know how he is.

23:11.960 --> 23:13.170
He can't win against you.

23:14.200 --> 23:15.000
He'll be fine.

23:15.970 --> 23:17.401
I've called him several times.

23:17.470 --> 23:18.401
He didn't pick up.

23:20.010 --> 23:22.041
When has he ever not picked up my calls?

23:22.881 --> 23:23.911
Don't worry.

23:25.480 --> 23:27.450
Give him some time to think.

23:38.791 --> 23:41.161
(Yan Chen)

24:00.750 --> 24:01.551
Yan Chen.

24:02.051 --> 24:03.950
Why didn't you answer my calls?

24:07.391 --> 24:08.250
Hello?

24:09.920 --> 24:10.791
Who are you?

24:13.730 --> 24:14.760
Where's Meng Yan Chen?

25:05.081 --> 25:05.811
Hello?

25:08.051 --> 25:08.851
Class Monitor.

25:12.020 --> 25:13.791
Help me.

25:15.020 --> 25:16.690
Save me.

25:20.831 --> 25:22.631
I was raped.

25:24.401 --> 25:25.430
Right now,

25:25.631 --> 25:27.270
I don't know...

25:27.631 --> 25:28.871
what to do.

25:30.270 --> 25:31.641
Help me.

25:41.980 --> 25:43.051
Mr. and Mrs. Meng.

25:43.121 --> 25:44.180
Mr. Guo is here.

25:48.950 --> 25:50.161
You still can't reach him?

25:50.690 --> 25:51.361
No.

25:51.990 --> 25:53.391
Should we call the police?

25:54.730 --> 25:56.460
But we have no reason to call the police.

25:56.930 --> 25:58.500
And given the situation,

25:59.131 --> 26:00.801
the other party is claiming to be the victim.

26:00.970 --> 26:01.970
If we call the police,

26:02.030 --> 26:03.641
we'll be walking into the trap.

26:03.841 --> 26:04.571
Don't call the police yet.

26:05.801 --> 26:06.740
These days,

26:07.341 --> 26:08.911
our family has been through enough.

26:09.510 --> 26:11.440
Whether this really happened or not,

26:11.680 --> 26:12.480
if this gets out of hand,

26:12.950 --> 26:14.051
it won't be good for us.

26:18.180 --> 26:19.220
I want to know.

26:19.990 --> 26:21.690
Do you want to pay her off to settle the matter?

26:22.121 --> 26:22.990
Or...

26:23.361 --> 26:24.821
do you want to teach her a lesson?

26:30.530 --> 26:34.631
(How much do you want?)

26:34.700 --> 26:36.871
(Five million yuan.)

26:40.670 --> 26:44.280
(I hope you can do as you say.)

26:44.780 --> 26:46.280
(Okay.)

26:49.551 --> 26:50.980
(Send your card number.)

26:54.651 --> 26:58.960
(Yancheng Bank 62...)

26:59.020 --> 27:00.530
If you send that message,

27:01.930 --> 27:03.000
you'll go to jail.

27:03.861 --> 27:04.730
You're not drunk?

27:06.631 --> 27:08.430
Not to the point of losing consciousness.

27:11.200 --> 27:12.670
What do you mean by what you said just now?

27:25.351 --> 27:26.690
If you send your card number,

27:28.220 --> 27:29.220
you'll go to jail immediately...

27:30.321 --> 27:31.161
for extortion.

27:32.520 --> 27:33.661
You can't defeat her.

27:34.831 --> 27:35.831
I have proof.

27:36.760 --> 27:37.500
Earlier, you...

27:37.561 --> 27:38.401
What did I do?

27:39.430 --> 27:40.631
I have a video on my phone.

27:40.901 --> 27:42.000
- You... - I'm just drunk,

27:43.071 --> 27:44.270
not dead.

27:56.551 --> 27:57.980
Are you really not afraid that I'll call the police?

27:58.051 --> 27:59.420
You'll be doomed if I call the police!

28:07.460 --> 28:08.331
Try it.

28:09.661 --> 28:10.760
I really want to see...

28:11.561 --> 28:13.030
how I'll be doomed.

28:29.980 --> 28:30.780
Are you going to call the police or not?

28:34.391 --> 28:35.121
No?

28:36.760 --> 28:37.591
I'll get going.

28:48.170 --> 28:48.901
Hello?

28:48.970 --> 28:49.901
This is the 110 reporting center.

28:54.141 --> 28:56.881
(Send your card number.)

28:58.680 --> 29:00.280
Why hasn't she replied yet?

29:00.450 --> 29:01.780
Do you think...

29:02.280 --> 29:03.381
she noticed something?

29:04.551 --> 29:05.980
I don't think so.

29:06.791 --> 29:07.821
Under such circumstances,

29:08.220 --> 29:10.220
it's impossible for her to react so quickly.

29:18.161 --> 29:18.831
Hello?

29:18.901 --> 29:19.661
Bad news, Mr. Meng.

29:20.170 --> 29:21.571
Mr. Meng Yan Chen was taken away by the police.

29:25.641 --> 29:26.411
Meng Yan Chen.

29:27.111 --> 29:29.440
Do you have anything to say about the fact...

29:29.740 --> 29:31.311
that you raped someone?

30:08.480 --> 30:09.280
Hello.

30:09.581 --> 30:11.220
We're Mr. Meng Yan Chen's parents.

30:11.280 --> 30:12.551
Can we see him?

30:12.651 --> 30:13.520
According to the rules,

30:13.591 --> 30:14.551
except for the lawyer,

30:14.690 --> 30:16.391
the rest of you can't see the suspect.

30:16.990 --> 30:17.821
Suspect?

30:18.690 --> 30:20.230
My son is not a suspect.

30:20.861 --> 30:22.391
That woman blackmailed us.

30:22.930 --> 30:24.361
There's something fishy about this.

30:24.430 --> 30:25.430
We want to see him.

30:26.401 --> 30:27.071
How about this?

30:27.871 --> 30:29.200
Let my lawyer in.

30:30.000 --> 30:31.440
It's no use even if the lawyer sees him.

30:31.700 --> 30:32.401
He...

30:33.071 --> 30:34.010
What?

30:34.341 --> 30:35.240
He didn't deny it.

30:40.980 --> 30:42.081
Come up with something.

30:42.381 --> 30:43.250
I want to see him.

30:43.321 --> 30:45.081
I'm afraid he's gone insane.

30:51.920 --> 30:52.591
Xu Qin.

30:52.990 --> 30:54.190
Why are you back at this hour?

30:54.561 --> 30:55.530
There's an urgent matter.

30:55.631 --> 30:56.930
Get changed and come with me.

30:57.200 --> 30:58.000
What's wrong?

31:04.440 --> 31:05.940
Hello, Xiao Yi Xiao. What's up?

31:06.200 --> 31:06.911
Qin Er.

31:06.970 --> 31:07.940
Listen, your brother is in trouble.

31:09.240 --> 31:10.240
What happened?

31:12.041 --> 31:13.450
Tell me if he's all right first.

31:13.551 --> 31:14.381
Where are you?

31:14.551 --> 31:16.051
I'll come to you. We'll talk in person.

31:32.760 --> 31:33.500
What's going on?

31:34.401 --> 31:35.230
See for yourself.

31:49.581 --> 31:53.391
(It's fine even if you hack someone like that to death.)

31:57.260 --> 31:57.920
They're...

31:58.490 --> 31:59.791
Are they referring to Meng Yan Chen?

32:01.030 --> 32:02.831
Listen, these netizens don't know anything.

32:03.161 --> 32:04.631
They're just fanning the flames.

32:05.601 --> 32:07.000
Could someone have a grudge against the Meng family,

32:07.071 --> 32:07.901
so she's doing this to him?

32:08.270 --> 32:09.071
I don't know.

32:09.631 --> 32:11.571
The entire Meng family is in uproar now.

32:12.301 --> 32:14.541
Most importantly, I don't know what Meng Yan Chen is doing.

32:14.611 --> 32:15.541
He wouldn't say a word.

32:15.811 --> 32:16.581
He wouldn't even say anything to the lawyer.

32:16.641 --> 32:17.881
He didn't even explain himself.

32:18.841 --> 32:19.780
Now that things have gotten out of hand,

32:19.841 --> 32:20.950
we can't even see him.

32:21.250 --> 32:22.051
If this drags on,

32:22.111 --> 32:23.581
nothing will come out of the investigation.

32:23.720 --> 32:25.450
If public opinion turns white into black,

32:25.520 --> 32:26.821
he'll be ruined.

32:31.020 --> 32:32.020
Last night,

32:34.361 --> 32:35.791
he must have been home too.

32:37.801 --> 32:39.361
He must have heard it.

32:40.430 --> 32:41.470
What did he hear?

32:59.651 --> 33:00.621
Dad, Mom.

33:02.750 --> 33:03.520
Qin Qin.

33:04.361 --> 33:06.291
If you have anything to say to your brother,

33:06.361 --> 33:07.960
let Mr. Guo pass it on.

33:10.000 --> 33:11.960
You must get your brother to talk,

33:12.030 --> 33:12.930
so he won't do stupid things.

33:13.000 --> 33:14.500
He'll ruin himself if he does that.

33:18.270 --> 33:18.940
Hello.

33:19.000 --> 33:19.740
Hi.

33:20.270 --> 33:21.911
Please tell my brother...

33:22.641 --> 33:23.480
that if there's any problem,

33:24.041 --> 33:24.940
we'll settle it at home.

33:25.641 --> 33:26.510
Is that all?

33:47.631 --> 33:49.631
Does that girl work at your bar?

33:50.170 --> 33:51.341
She hasn't worked there for a long time.

33:51.401 --> 33:52.740
I knew something wasn't right with her,

33:52.801 --> 33:53.710
so I fired her.

33:54.141 --> 33:56.270
I'm sure she went back there because the staff tipped her off.

33:57.480 --> 33:58.740
I really didn't expect this...

33:58.911 --> 33:59.740
to become such a big deal.

34:00.881 --> 34:01.680
The netizens are saying...

34:02.280 --> 34:04.220
that Meng Yan Chen and the bar owner are also good friends,

34:04.280 --> 34:05.520
so any statement the bar makes...

34:05.750 --> 34:06.791
will be useless.

34:08.151 --> 34:09.391
Are there no cameras in the bar?

34:10.690 --> 34:11.490
There are in the corridor...

34:11.561 --> 34:12.791
but not in the rooms.

34:13.460 --> 34:15.331
I also captured a customer by the door.

34:15.391 --> 34:17.260
He should have seen what happened inside.

34:17.530 --> 34:19.161
But I can't find this person.

34:19.601 --> 34:21.030
And no one came forward to testify.

34:24.101 --> 34:25.171
How is this person related...

34:25.470 --> 34:26.541
to Meng Yan Chen?

34:28.041 --> 34:29.141
What relationship can they have?

34:29.340 --> 34:30.411
Look at Meng Yan Chen's personality.

34:30.541 --> 34:31.441
He's not me.

34:31.840 --> 34:32.510
Let me tell you.

34:32.581 --> 34:34.911
This girl is using her good looks...

34:35.180 --> 34:36.081
and she likes Meng Yan Chen.

34:36.150 --> 34:36.981
She wants to be with him.

34:37.150 --> 34:38.050
She was exposed,

34:38.180 --> 34:39.121
so her love turned into hate.

34:39.550 --> 34:40.921
"If I can't have you, I'll destroy you."

34:40.990 --> 34:41.921
That's all.

34:43.090 --> 34:44.490
You said the CCTV showed...

34:44.691 --> 34:46.621
a customer watching by the door, right?

34:47.030 --> 34:47.791
Look.

34:48.391 --> 34:49.860
The police took the video,

34:49.930 --> 34:51.200
but I took a photo.

34:51.831 --> 34:53.231
I can't find this person now.

34:56.030 --> 34:56.871
I need to go somewhere.

35:00.141 --> 35:00.911
Mr. Meng.

35:04.610 --> 35:06.110
What did Yan Chen say?

35:07.481 --> 35:08.581
He wouldn't say anything.

35:09.150 --> 35:10.351
He wouldn't say a word.

35:14.391 --> 35:15.921
Did you tell him...

35:16.691 --> 35:18.021
not to do this because he's mad at me?

35:18.621 --> 35:19.791
He can hate me.

35:20.161 --> 35:20.990
However,

35:21.430 --> 35:23.860
he can't gamble with his reputation.

35:24.360 --> 35:25.731
I told him all of that,

35:26.030 --> 35:27.070
but he wouldn't listen.

35:30.070 --> 35:31.601
I know my son.

35:33.411 --> 35:35.110
He would never do such a thing.

35:36.441 --> 35:37.641
Now, we need to find a way...

35:37.711 --> 35:38.441
to tell everyone...

35:39.081 --> 35:40.880
the most believable truth.

35:41.081 --> 35:42.851
Then we need to find a witness and evidence.

35:45.751 --> 35:47.621
Didn't they say that a customer saw it?

35:47.791 --> 35:49.191
Find this person first.

35:49.391 --> 35:50.121
Hurry.

35:50.490 --> 35:51.191
Okay.

36:48.711 --> 36:49.981
Why didn't you answer my calls?

36:51.450 --> 36:52.450
What do you want?

36:52.521 --> 36:53.590
Regarding what happened to Meng Yan Chen,

36:54.291 --> 36:56.121
are you the key witness captured on the CCTV?

36:57.291 --> 36:58.561
I don't know what you're talking about.

36:58.720 --> 36:59.521
Stop playing dumb.

36:59.891 --> 37:01.791
Even if you put on a sack and ran 100m away,

37:02.130 --> 37:03.360
I can recognize you.

37:04.001 --> 37:05.360
Then why are you helping them?

37:06.760 --> 37:07.430
That's not right.

37:08.200 --> 37:09.771
Why would the police show you the CCTV footage?

37:10.200 --> 37:11.171
You're trying to fish up information from me.

37:14.311 --> 37:14.970
Zhai Miao.

37:16.311 --> 37:17.911
I thought you knew the priority of things...

37:18.510 --> 37:19.941
and won't do anything that harms people.

37:21.550 --> 37:22.351
Hey.

37:22.711 --> 37:23.780
You don't think...

37:23.851 --> 37:25.581
the online post has anything to do with me, do you?

37:25.921 --> 37:26.921
You're not that bad.

37:30.191 --> 37:30.990
Say something.

37:33.961 --> 37:35.391
Ye Zi called the class monitor.

37:35.791 --> 37:36.760
The class monitor was heartbroken,

37:36.831 --> 37:38.061
so she even called the Student Council.

37:38.860 --> 37:40.271
Ye Zi was crying...

37:41.171 --> 37:42.771
and said she was raped.

37:42.831 --> 37:44.041
Meng Yan Chen has a strong background.

37:44.400 --> 37:45.601
Everyone was angry,

37:45.800 --> 37:47.311
so they wanted to post something online.

37:47.510 --> 37:48.941
Anyway, I didn't take part in it,

37:49.010 --> 37:49.941
but I didn't stop them.

37:50.541 --> 37:51.811
I was just watching the whole thing play out.

38:05.921 --> 38:06.820
You know...

38:07.961 --> 38:09.831
that Meng Yan Chen didn't rape Ye Zi.

38:12.260 --> 38:13.061
I don't know that.

38:13.161 --> 38:13.970
How would I know?

38:14.171 --> 38:15.430
Since you didn't want to join them,

38:16.171 --> 38:17.070
why didn't you tell the truth?

38:17.240 --> 38:18.171
What truth?

38:18.240 --> 38:19.271
I didn't take part.

38:19.441 --> 38:20.541
I have a clear conscience.

38:20.911 --> 38:21.671
I had nothing to do...

38:21.740 --> 38:23.041
with the post they made.

38:23.110 --> 38:24.840
I didn't even like the post or leave a comment.

38:24.941 --> 38:26.641
You know that's not true.

38:30.481 --> 38:31.450
You have proof.

38:32.121 --> 38:33.380
You saw it by the door.

38:34.391 --> 38:35.490
You took photos too, didn't you?

38:44.001 --> 38:45.360
You know this matter is urgent.

38:45.961 --> 38:47.030
If this drags on,

38:48.171 --> 38:49.271
Meng Yan Chen will be ruined.

38:50.671 --> 38:51.441
He'll be ruined?

38:51.871 --> 38:53.240
Even so, he'll still be 100 times better off than you.

38:53.300 --> 38:54.541
It's none of your concern.

39:08.891 --> 39:10.220
If you just hate the Meng family,

39:10.921 --> 39:11.760
there's no need to do this.

39:12.621 --> 39:13.461
I don't care...

39:13.731 --> 39:14.760
about what happened in the past anymore.

39:15.561 --> 39:16.731
Don't act up too.

39:20.260 --> 39:21.570
But if you have proof,

39:22.831 --> 39:23.900
come with me to the police station.

39:25.271 --> 39:26.141
You don't care?

39:26.541 --> 39:27.811
Why?

39:28.671 --> 39:29.711
If I graduated from senior high...

39:29.771 --> 39:31.481
and sold socks at the overpass for 10 years,

39:31.880 --> 39:32.840
then I told you...

39:33.110 --> 39:34.411
that I got into Yancheng University...

39:34.481 --> 39:36.180
because someone ruined my grades,

39:36.481 --> 39:37.550
would you be okay with it too?

39:38.380 --> 39:39.521
If I got into graduate school,

39:39.751 --> 39:40.950
and someone reported me...

39:41.220 --> 39:42.490
and made me lose my right to take the exam,

39:42.550 --> 39:43.820
would you be okay with that too?

39:45.691 --> 39:46.421
Song Yan.

39:47.130 --> 39:48.630
Can you really be okay with it?

39:49.760 --> 39:51.101
Your youth,

39:51.161 --> 39:53.101
the best decade of your life, was ruined by someone.

39:53.871 --> 39:56.570
Everything you worked so hard for was in vain.

39:57.771 --> 39:58.900
Have you forgotten all of that?

40:00.811 --> 40:02.441
How did my dad beg her before?

40:03.340 --> 40:04.411
Have you forgotten too?

40:10.720 --> 40:11.380
Zhai Miao.

40:11.450 --> 40:12.150
Song Yan.

40:12.550 --> 40:13.751
Stop pretending with me.

40:14.121 --> 40:14.851
You say you don't care.

40:14.921 --> 40:16.391
You say you don't care. You say you don't harbor hatred.

40:17.791 --> 40:19.161
If you really don't care,

40:19.760 --> 40:21.961
when Xu Qin first came to see you last year,

40:22.831 --> 40:24.400
why did you chase her away?

40:25.061 --> 40:26.030
If you really don't care,

40:26.101 --> 40:27.671
why do you have so many books at home?

40:27.900 --> 40:29.900
Why are you working so hard too?

40:40.280 --> 40:41.411
If it really doesn't matter to you,

40:41.481 --> 40:42.581
if you really don't care,

40:43.351 --> 40:44.780
our family wouldn't be so careful...

40:44.851 --> 40:46.780
in not mentioning what happened for so many years.

40:47.950 --> 40:49.720
We were afraid it would hurt your pride.

40:50.561 --> 40:53.320
Now, you want to forgive them because of Xu Qin.

40:55.360 --> 40:56.731
That's your decision.

40:57.430 --> 40:58.260
I won't.

40:58.860 --> 41:00.200
I'll never forgive them.
